======================================================================================================================
MATHEMATICAL INTERPRETATION
======================================================================================================================
The sweep separates two mathematical sectors:

RADIAL SECTOR

  mu_eff -> R = mu_eff^(1/3)
         -> Phi
         -> alpha

PROJECTION SECTOR

  eta -> A=eta
      -> B=1-eta
      -> f_c=sqrt(eta)

  (A,B,pi/4) -> A'=1/sqrt(2)

  P_geo = f_c/A'
        = sqrt(6/5)

Therefore changing the radial effective state does not
change the canonical projection factor under this architecture.

